1
00:01:30,460 --> 00:01:34,979
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,530 --> 00:01:37,950
[Episode 19]

3
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:45,410
Are you alright?

4
00:01:47,590 --> 00:01:48,280
I'm fine.

5
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,700
Then I'm relieved.

6
00:01:51,950 --> 00:01:53,750
Do you still have the negatives?

7
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,590
Keep the negatives safe,

8
00:01:55,590 --> 00:01:56,430
just in case.

9
00:01:58,509 --> 00:02:00,510
It's time to put them to use.

10
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,620
Once you leave the police station,

11
00:02:48,620 --> 00:02:50,280
I won't be able to protect you.

12
00:03:07,140 --> 00:03:09,100
So leaving now is not a good idea.

13
00:03:09,590 --> 00:03:12,680
I can detain you for a little longer.

14
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:15,430
No need.

15
00:04:40,950 --> 00:04:43,040
I received 2 sets of photos.

16
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:48,000
One shows Inspector Su
colluding with the Communists.

17
00:04:50,270 --> 00:04:51,270
The other shows

18
00:04:52,390 --> 00:04:54,990
the details of No. 76
embezzling public funds.

19
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,830
One of you two

20
00:05:00,270 --> 00:05:01,680
is lying.

21
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:05,960
Director Li.

22
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:10,490
That relative of yours
in the finance department

23
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,650
cooked the books beautifully.

24
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:16,360
Without this authentic ledger,

25
00:05:17,310 --> 00:05:18,560
I'm afraid no one would know

26
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:20,310
how much
of the 300,000 special monthly fund

27
00:05:20,310 --> 00:05:21,720
actually

28
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:23,180
went into your own pocket.

29
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:32,860
You think you can use a few random words
in a notebook

30
00:05:33,330 --> 00:05:34,770
to frame anyone?

31
00:05:38,670 --> 00:05:41,720
You can also forge evidence of me
colluding with the Communists

32
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:43,050
and plant it in my house.

33
00:05:47,750 --> 00:05:48,510
Come in.

34
00:06:00,130 --> 00:06:01,460
This is your man, right?

35
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:23,200
You didn't even spare the women's jewelry,

36
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:26,240
and you still claim you're not corrupt?

37
00:06:29,260 --> 00:06:32,320
How did Inspector Su's belongings
end up in your hands?

38
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,630
I... I'll talk.

39
00:06:41,110 --> 00:06:43,190
They sent people to search your house

40
00:06:43,950 --> 00:06:45,520
and couldn't find evidence of collusion,

41
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:46,520
so they forged it.

42
00:06:47,830 --> 00:06:49,820
Ding Awang gave me a radio
and some documents

43
00:06:49,820 --> 00:06:51,530
implicating Inspector Su in collusion
with the Communists.

44
00:06:51,530 --> 00:06:53,390
He told me to take them to her house

45
00:06:53,510 --> 00:06:55,970
and plant them as evidence
of her collusion.

46
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:57,560
As a reward,

47
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,630
he said we... we could keep the valuables

48
00:07:00,630 --> 00:07:01,490
for ourselves.

49
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:05,510
You turned my house upside down.

50
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,660
Weren't you afraid I'd get out

51
00:07:09,040 --> 00:07:10,700
and settle the score with you?

52
00:07:12,070 --> 00:07:12,930
Ding Awang said

53
00:07:13,870 --> 00:07:15,680
you wouldn't come back alive.

54
00:07:17,750 --> 00:07:19,830
It was Captain Du's order.

55
00:07:25,510 --> 00:07:26,390
Louder!

56
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,890
Ding Awang said it was Captain Du's order!

57
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:49,800
Captain Du,

58
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,590
was it your order?

59
00:07:52,870 --> 00:07:54,750
Searching your house was my order,

60
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:56,070
but the framing

61
00:07:56,450 --> 00:07:57,850
had nothing to do with me.

62
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:03,720
Ding Awang is your right-hand man.

63
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:06,630
Without your order,

64
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,490
would he have dared?

65
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,310
Ding Awang always talks nonsense.

66
00:08:13,500 --> 00:08:15,500
Maybe he was just saying it.

67
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,600
What about these?

68
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,150
These.

69
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,720
How do you explain it?

70
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:48,240
To cover up the embezzlement,

71
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:50,970
you framed me
for colluding with the Communists.

72
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,510
You colluded with the Green Gang,

73
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:53,750
trying to silence me.

74
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:00,910
Cui Enxi was a civil servant

75
00:09:00,910 --> 00:09:03,640
officially employed
by the Nanjing Government.

76
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:06,400
And she was brutally

77
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:09,350
murdered by you like that
in broad daylight!

78
00:09:13,620 --> 00:09:14,950
How do you explain that?

79
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:29,620
I failed to discipline my subordinates.

80
00:09:29,710 --> 00:09:31,630
I will resign to take responsibility

81
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:33,030
and await my punishment.

82
00:09:37,750 --> 00:09:39,910
A human life cannot be repaid

83
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:42,020
just by your resignation.

84
00:09:45,150 --> 00:09:45,790
Of course.

85
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,360
A life for a life.

86
00:09:48,910 --> 00:09:49,720
Ding Awang

87
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,460
should be brought to justice.

88
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:02,630
Director Li.

89
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:05,530
What about you?

90
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:11,750
Such a serious accusation
as embezzling public funds

91
00:10:11,870 --> 00:10:13,030
cannot be proven

92
00:10:13,270 --> 00:10:14,550
by just one ledger.

93
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,630
But as the head of No. 76,

94
00:10:19,310 --> 00:10:21,640
I am willing to accept any investigation.

95
00:10:26,330 --> 00:10:28,370
All subsequent matters

96
00:10:29,390 --> 00:10:31,650
will be fully entrusted to Inspector Su.

97
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:38,080
Considering the risks
you face in Shanghai,

98
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:40,880
the Ministry of Finance
of the Central Government

99
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,320
can approve your return

100
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,980
to work in Nanjing at any time.

101
00:10:47,630 --> 00:10:49,630
Even if I die, I will die in Shanghai.

102
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:53,030
My inspection mission is not yet complete.

103
00:10:53,790 --> 00:10:56,320
Chairman Wang was right about you.

104
00:10:57,150 --> 00:10:58,600
The corrupt officials

105
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:01,000
mentioned in the ledger, led by Li Moqun—

106
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:03,050
I will investigate them one by one.

107
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,360
The Chairman personally ordered

108
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:07,240
that the bandits
who attacked government officials

109
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:08,910
must be severely punished.

110
00:11:09,260 --> 00:11:11,460
I appreciate Chairman Wang's concern.

111
00:11:20,910 --> 00:11:22,860
-Freeze!
-Freeze! Freeze!

112
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,770
Take them alive!

113
00:12:40,270 --> 00:12:42,030
A life for a life.

114
00:12:44,500 --> 00:12:45,360
Is that enough?

115
00:12:57,690 --> 00:12:58,810
Not even close.

116
00:13:04,650 --> 00:13:05,720
They are just

117
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,510
scapegoats following orders.

118
00:13:08,510 --> 00:13:10,510
The man behind them is Li Moqun.

119
00:13:11,420 --> 00:13:15,020
The evidence of Li Moqun
embezzling public funds is conclusive.

120
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,750
How to deal with him still requires

121
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:20,550
Chairman Wang's personal decision.

122
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:23,030
Minister Ding has been lobbying.

123
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:25,240
There's more going on

124
00:13:25,420 --> 00:13:26,660
behind the scenes.

125
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:53,050
I'm responsible for this.

126
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,210
I failed to discipline
my subordinates properly

127
00:13:56,210 --> 00:13:57,750
and disappointed the Chairman.

128
00:13:57,750 --> 00:13:59,210
The Chairman is very angry

129
00:13:59,390 --> 00:14:00,550
and doesn't want to talk to you.

130
00:14:00,550 --> 00:14:01,810
Don't you understand?

131
00:14:02,580 --> 00:14:03,840
I will resign to take responsibility

132
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,660
and give the Japanese an explanation,

133
00:14:05,660 --> 00:14:08,920
as a way of repaying the Chairman
for his years of guidance.

134
00:14:09,630 --> 00:14:11,150
What's the use of your resignation?

135
00:14:11,150 --> 00:14:13,350
Don't pull this trick on me all the time!

136
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,790
The key now

137
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,530
is to keep this matter
from going any further!

138
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,520
Fortunately,

139
00:14:19,630 --> 00:14:22,600
Yu Yingxiang left your name
out of the ledger.

140
00:14:23,110 --> 00:14:23,590
You...

141
00:14:40,120 --> 00:14:40,870
Director Li,

142
00:14:42,270 --> 00:14:44,080
I tried my best to plead

143
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,480
with the Chairman

144
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:47,080
and got you another chance.

145
00:14:47,670 --> 00:14:49,330
You'd better watch your step.

146
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,420
Thank you, Minister Ding.

147
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:52,750
Please thank the Chairman

148
00:14:52,750 --> 00:14:54,270
for giving me this chance.

149
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:56,040
Rest assured.

150
00:14:56,790 --> 00:14:59,430
I can minimize the impact.

151
00:15:01,050 --> 00:15:03,770
I won't let you down.

152
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:04,840
Alright.

153
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,140
Let's leave it at that for now.

154
00:16:14,830 --> 00:16:17,160
You made a beautiful comeback this round.

155
00:16:23,550 --> 00:16:24,740
But what a pity.

156
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:27,600
If it were me,

157
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:31,510
I wouldn't have given my opponent
any chance to fight back.

158
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:39,650
There's plenty of time.

159
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:27,589
Are you missing those fallen comrades?

160
00:17:33,830 --> 00:17:34,750
Not comrades.

161
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,640
They were family.

162
00:17:39,830 --> 00:17:41,230
And I'm not missing them.

163
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:43,760
It's a farewell.

164
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:52,720
Anyway,

165
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:56,070
congratulations on surviving the ordeal.

166
00:17:56,070 --> 00:17:57,470
Welcome back to the team.

167
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:10,220
I managed to save these when they were

168
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:12,050
ransacking your house.

169
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:18,510
You look good in these shoes.

170
00:18:29,220 --> 00:18:29,870
Thank you.

171
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,160
What a pity.

172
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:36,820
Even this didn't bring Li Moqun down.

173
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,590
Du Huangqiao

174
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,680
was only dismissed.

175
00:18:47,590 --> 00:18:50,390
Li Moqun has deep roots
in the Nanjing Government.

176
00:18:51,500 --> 00:18:53,300
None of the witnesses survived.

177
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:56,640
These officials

178
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,880
are rotten from top to bottom.

179
00:19:00,310 --> 00:19:02,200
It's impossible to bring him down

180
00:19:02,980 --> 00:19:04,310
on corruption charges.

181
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:18,830
The skies will clear one day.

182
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:22,930
As long as we keep believing

183
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:25,030
and fighting for it.

184
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:31,510
I didn't expect

185
00:19:32,750 --> 00:19:34,310
you to be the last one left.

186
00:20:09,550 --> 00:20:10,440
There's news.

187
00:20:11,450 --> 00:20:13,710
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

188
00:20:13,790 --> 00:20:15,390
It's about Project Slumber.

189
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:49,820
You've been dismissed.

190
00:20:51,110 --> 00:20:53,960
Why do you think I'll still use you?

191
00:20:55,990 --> 00:20:58,790
You don't care who attacked Su Men,

192
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:01,830
let alone the dead bodyguard.

193
00:21:02,320 --> 00:21:04,160
I know that much.

194
00:21:06,350 --> 00:21:07,790
What you care about

195
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:10,200
is who's more useful to you.

196
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:13,040
And my intelligence network

197
00:21:13,320 --> 00:21:15,080
can definitely be of use to you.

198
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:20,210
I've long heard that Cleaner is a master
in the intelligence field.

199
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:21,880
I'm all ears.

200
00:21:25,310 --> 00:21:27,510
There's an NBIS mole inside your ranks.

201
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:32,380
They've already made a move
on Project Slumber.

202
00:21:38,830 --> 00:21:40,400
Where did you learn this?

203
00:21:43,590 --> 00:21:45,640
I dug up an NBIS stronghold.

204
00:21:45,790 --> 00:21:46,590
Tomorrow,

205
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:49,440
your mole will meet with God of Wealth.

206
00:21:51,360 --> 00:21:53,760
How much do you know about
Project Slumber?

207
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:57,030
I know nothing,

208
00:21:57,050 --> 00:21:58,380
and I don't want to know.

209
00:21:59,510 --> 00:22:01,310
I'm just an executioner.

210
00:22:01,720 --> 00:22:04,590
I can help you deal with the NBIS.

211
00:22:14,630 --> 00:22:17,060
I've always appreciated your abilities.

212
00:22:18,200 --> 00:22:18,960
Work hard,

213
00:22:20,350 --> 00:22:22,510
and I can secure a good future for you.

214
00:22:23,920 --> 00:22:25,830
My future is very important to me.

215
00:22:25,830 --> 00:22:27,760
But what's more important to me now

216
00:22:30,310 --> 00:22:32,070
is who God of Wealth is.

217
00:22:35,470 --> 00:22:36,600
You want revenge?

218
00:22:40,890 --> 00:22:42,690
The shot that killed my woman

219
00:22:44,180 --> 00:22:45,640
was fired by God of Wealth.

220
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:50,440
I support you.

221
00:22:52,840 --> 00:22:53,970
Thank you, General.

222
00:23:14,920 --> 00:23:15,680
Jinbao.

223
00:23:17,830 --> 00:23:19,090
I'm leaving tomorrow.

224
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,000
I know that.

225
00:23:21,350 --> 00:23:22,950
Haven't you already told me?

226
00:23:23,240 --> 00:23:26,030
Why don't you go with me?

227
00:23:28,550 --> 00:23:30,160
Aren't you bankrupt?

228
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:32,400
You have no money now.

229
00:23:33,160 --> 00:23:34,760
Why would I still follow you?

230
00:23:35,750 --> 00:23:36,550
In Chongqing,

231
00:23:36,830 --> 00:23:38,830
we'll open another small match factory.

232
00:23:38,830 --> 00:23:40,630
I'm very good at making matches.

233
00:23:40,720 --> 00:23:41,980
Just give me some time.

234
00:23:43,110 --> 00:23:43,880
No way.

235
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:47,550
I'm staying in Shanghai from now on.

236
00:23:48,590 --> 00:23:50,200
Just imagine me as

237
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:52,200
a utility pole.

238
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:55,210
I'm not joking with you.

239
00:23:55,840 --> 00:23:57,030
I really can't let you go.

240
00:23:57,030 --> 00:23:59,230
It's dangerous for you to be here alone.

241
00:23:59,750 --> 00:24:00,880
How is it dangerous?

242
00:24:01,350 --> 00:24:03,000
Can those men eat me?

243
00:24:03,570 --> 00:24:04,630
It's Du Huangqiao.

244
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:07,640
He's very dangerous.

245
00:24:10,840 --> 00:24:12,500
What does he have to do with me?

246
00:24:13,880 --> 00:24:15,070
That day at MGM,

247
00:24:16,030 --> 00:24:17,160
I saw everything.

248
00:24:27,640 --> 00:24:29,170
You managed to escape once,

249
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:31,300
but can you escape every time?

250
00:24:34,440 --> 00:24:35,750
So what if I can't?

251
00:24:36,790 --> 00:24:37,720
You'll die!

252
00:24:39,240 --> 00:24:40,640
What's with the yelling?

253
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:43,760
What's so scary about death?

254
00:24:48,690 --> 00:24:49,750
Death isn't scary.

255
00:24:50,760 --> 00:24:52,490
What's scary is that the living

256
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:54,890
will live in fear and have no peace!

257
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:58,840
That day,
to take over the match factory, No. 76

258
00:24:59,270 --> 00:25:00,830
falsely accused my father

259
00:25:00,830 --> 00:25:02,360
of colluding with the NBIS.

260
00:25:03,030 --> 00:25:04,640
He was locked up in No. 76.

261
00:25:05,270 --> 00:25:06,440
No matter how hard I tried
to pull strings,

262
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:08,100
I couldn't get any news of him.

263
00:25:09,970 --> 00:25:11,140
All I could do

264
00:25:12,030 --> 00:25:13,110
was wait at home.

265
00:25:14,070 --> 00:25:15,400
But I waited and waited,

266
00:25:16,230 --> 00:25:17,000
only to learn

267
00:25:17,880 --> 00:25:20,940
that he had taken his own life
out of fear of punishment.

268
00:25:21,030 --> 00:25:22,770
My father never colluded with the NBIS!

269
00:25:22,770 --> 00:25:23,980
You killed him!

270
00:25:27,810 --> 00:25:29,200
What a good knife.

271
00:25:30,380 --> 00:25:32,750
This is my 18th birthday present
from my father.

272
00:25:32,750 --> 00:25:33,750
Give it back to me!

273
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:39,980
Alright, alright.

274
00:25:41,000 --> 00:25:42,000
I'll give it back.

275
00:25:43,310 --> 00:25:44,310
Give me your hand.

276
00:26:05,450 --> 00:26:07,000
Such little courage?

277
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:10,550
You are nothing compared to your old man.

278
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:25,660
Inspector Su will probably send someone
to ask questions.

279
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:30,250
You know what to say, right?

280
00:26:34,070 --> 00:26:35,310
I'll count to three.

281
00:26:37,790 --> 00:26:38,590
One...

282
00:26:41,110 --> 00:26:42,000
Two...

283
00:26:42,310 --> 00:26:42,960
I do!

284
00:26:44,620 --> 00:26:47,680
My father committed suicide
out of fear of punishment.

285
00:26:47,790 --> 00:26:51,120
And my family agreed
to have the match factory confiscated,

286
00:26:52,720 --> 00:26:54,120
without any complaints.

287
00:26:57,710 --> 00:26:58,680
Good boy.

288
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:01,060
Since you had a knife in your hand,

289
00:27:01,550 --> 00:27:03,610
why didn't you just stab him to death?

290
00:27:05,720 --> 00:27:06,720
My father and I

291
00:27:07,600 --> 00:27:09,270
only know how to make matches.

292
00:27:10,750 --> 00:27:13,010
The quality of the matches is quite good.

293
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:18,400
Do you think you are pitiful?

294
00:27:20,550 --> 00:27:21,510
He bullied you

295
00:27:22,070 --> 00:27:23,730
because you are too cowardly.

296
00:27:23,920 --> 00:27:24,830
Go back.

297
00:27:27,480 --> 00:27:29,030
Mr. Fang, the owner of Sanxing Chemical,

298
00:27:29,030 --> 00:27:30,830
was driven to his death by No. 76!

299
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:33,460
He was only 47 when he died.

300
00:27:33,960 --> 00:27:36,030
What's the use of his title,
King of Domestic Goods?

301
00:27:36,030 --> 00:27:37,490
Try yelling one more time!

302
00:27:40,400 --> 00:27:42,000
Mr. Fang was driven to death by them.

303
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:43,720
And my father was driven to death by them!

304
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:45,350
Next, it will be you and me!

305
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:46,830
I'm telling you,

306
00:27:46,830 --> 00:27:49,360
it's very dangerous for you
to go on like this!

307
00:27:52,590 --> 00:27:53,880
Many people have died.

308
00:27:54,790 --> 00:27:55,790
Will running away

309
00:27:56,030 --> 00:27:58,270
make this country less dangerous?

310
00:28:12,020 --> 00:28:13,220
What a coward.

311
00:28:37,740 --> 00:28:39,950
[Fairy Bath]

312
00:28:58,440 --> 00:28:59,310
You're here.

313
00:29:01,830 --> 00:29:04,430
Seeing the lights at Fairy Bath finally
come on

314
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:07,170
reminded me
that you'd taken over this place.

315
00:29:13,070 --> 00:29:14,920
Xiaoxian and Awang are gone.

316
00:29:16,880 --> 00:29:18,640
I don't know how to do business,

317
00:29:19,540 --> 00:29:20,910
so I just closed it down.

318
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:26,410
Where have you been lately?

319
00:29:27,480 --> 00:29:29,960
I couldn't find you anywhere.

320
00:29:32,400 --> 00:29:34,200
I went back to my old profession,

321
00:29:34,590 --> 00:29:36,520
playing the three-stringed lute.

322
00:29:36,610 --> 00:29:38,540
Playing the three-stringed lute?

323
00:29:39,110 --> 00:29:41,040
You're not short of money, are you?

324
00:29:48,830 --> 00:29:50,240
Drive for me later.

325
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:51,800
I need you to come with me.

326
00:29:52,790 --> 00:29:53,510
Where to?

327
00:29:56,960 --> 00:29:58,400
Have you heard of an...

328
00:29:59,240 --> 00:30:02,000
NBIS agent codenamed God of Wealth?

329
00:30:11,790 --> 00:30:12,510
You have?

330
00:30:15,930 --> 00:30:16,610
I have.

331
00:30:28,030 --> 00:30:28,830
Today,

332
00:30:29,920 --> 00:30:31,920
I'll open your eyes.

333
00:30:36,680 --> 00:30:37,610
Where is Jinbao?

334
00:30:38,400 --> 00:30:39,330
Where is Jinbao?

335
00:30:39,790 --> 00:30:41,830
She went to see Young Master Feng off.

336
00:30:41,830 --> 00:30:42,680
Go find her.

337
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:45,360
Go find her. Tell her Du Huangqiao
is going to make an arrest this afternoon

338
00:30:45,360 --> 00:30:47,220
and seek revenge on God of Wealth.

339
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:48,550
You hear me?

340
00:30:50,940 --> 00:30:51,620
Go now!

341
00:30:51,900 --> 00:30:52,490
Alright.

342
00:31:00,560 --> 00:31:02,090
You went to get your camera?

343
00:31:02,910 --> 00:31:04,770
I also brought the gun you gave me.

344
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:10,070
A gun will rust if it's not used.

345
00:31:21,640 --> 00:31:22,350
Eat up.

346
00:31:22,680 --> 00:31:23,350
What?

347
00:31:23,830 --> 00:31:26,830
Do you look down on me
for only treating you to wontons?

348
00:31:32,110 --> 00:31:32,640
Here.

349
00:31:41,550 --> 00:31:42,510
What is this for?

350
00:31:44,350 --> 00:31:46,550
Didn't I borrow 5,000 yuan
from you before?

351
00:31:46,550 --> 00:31:47,240
Count it.

352
00:31:50,160 --> 00:31:50,880
Jinbao,

353
00:31:51,610 --> 00:31:53,740
you are the first person to pay me back.

354
00:31:54,680 --> 00:31:56,810
Don't make yourself sound so pitiful.

355
00:31:56,930 --> 00:31:58,410
I, Jinbao, am known

356
00:31:58,440 --> 00:31:59,680
for being trustworthy.

357
00:31:59,680 --> 00:32:02,210
I would never borrow money
and not pay it back.

358
00:32:04,270 --> 00:32:05,680
Jinbao, I know.

359
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:07,030
You care about me.

360
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:08,840
You're afraid I won't have enough money

361
00:32:08,840 --> 00:32:12,040
to get by after I leave.
That's why you're giving me money.

362
00:32:12,350 --> 00:32:13,920
You are the kindest,

363
00:32:14,270 --> 00:32:15,530
best girl in the world.

364
00:32:16,040 --> 00:32:17,510
Don't flatter yourself.

365
00:32:18,190 --> 00:32:20,320
Mr. Chen said the same thing about you.

366
00:32:21,070 --> 00:32:21,700
Really?

367
00:32:23,510 --> 00:32:24,710
Something like that.

368
00:32:41,250 --> 00:32:43,170
[Land and Property Ownership Certificate]

369
00:32:42,080 --> 00:32:43,400
Keep this house.

370
00:33:05,850 --> 00:33:06,480
Why?

371
00:33:08,030 --> 00:33:10,270
Don't worry. This is my mother's dowry.

372
00:33:10,360 --> 00:33:11,480
No one knows about it,

373
00:33:11,480 --> 00:33:12,590
not even my father.

374
00:33:13,270 --> 00:33:15,530
So it wasn't discovered by those people.

375
00:33:15,650 --> 00:33:16,510
It's very safe.

376
00:33:22,050 --> 00:33:23,750
What does this have to do with me?

377
00:33:23,750 --> 00:33:24,590
Listen to me,

378
00:33:24,880 --> 00:33:25,610
keep it well.

379
00:33:26,510 --> 00:33:28,270
In case of an emergency in the future,

380
00:33:28,270 --> 00:33:29,800
you'll have a place to stay.

381
00:33:36,480 --> 00:33:38,010
Chen Kailai sent a message,

382
00:33:38,170 --> 00:33:41,100
saying Du Huangqiao
is going to arrest God of Wealth.

383
00:33:44,130 --> 00:33:45,900
Go to Sanguantang Road, hurry.

384
00:33:46,200 --> 00:33:47,400
Why are we still going?

385
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:48,460
Hurry up and drive.

386
00:34:08,179 --> 00:34:09,460
Is their meeting place

387
00:34:10,830 --> 00:34:12,500
Wu's Grocery Store?

388
00:34:15,550 --> 00:34:17,480
You're more and more like an agent.

389
00:34:19,800 --> 00:34:21,000
When are they coming?

390
00:34:38,150 --> 00:34:39,110
You go first.

391
00:34:40,070 --> 00:34:41,070
Let me go instead.

392
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:43,440
It's too dangerous for you to go!

393
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:44,300
Get out of here.

394
00:34:44,630 --> 00:34:45,760
Don't cause trouble.

395
00:34:45,760 --> 00:34:47,159
I'm leaving soon anyway.

396
00:34:47,630 --> 00:34:49,560
I'll be fine once I leave Shanghai.

397
00:34:50,540 --> 00:34:51,770
If I do something for you before I leave,

398
00:34:51,770 --> 00:34:52,900
you'll remember me!

399
00:34:52,920 --> 00:34:54,320
Just go when I tell you to!

400
00:34:56,070 --> 00:34:57,270
You have to stay alive

401
00:34:59,190 --> 00:35:00,450
for me to remember you.

402
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:36,840
A catty of dates

403
00:35:37,110 --> 00:35:38,640
and a can of yellow peaches.

404
00:35:49,410 --> 00:35:51,410
We're out of canned yellow peaches.

405
00:36:05,800 --> 00:36:07,730
[Canned Food Sold Out]

406
00:36:09,530 --> 00:36:11,790
There's something wrong with this sign.

407
00:37:03,710 --> 00:37:04,360
Stop!

408
00:37:17,360 --> 00:37:18,290
Don't be afraid.

409
00:37:18,960 --> 00:37:20,710
When you dodge bullets long enough,

410
00:37:20,710 --> 00:37:21,710
you get used to it.

411
00:37:23,400 --> 00:37:24,860
I know this marksmanship.

412
00:37:25,110 --> 00:37:26,310
It's God of Wealth's.

413
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:27,680
Stay hidden.

414
00:37:35,190 --> 00:37:35,960
Stay hidden.

415
00:37:47,130 --> 00:37:48,150
I'll kill you!

416
00:38:37,630 --> 00:38:39,280
Did God of Wealth send you?

417
00:38:44,250 --> 00:38:45,160
I'm here...

418
00:38:45,870 --> 00:38:47,020
for revenge.

419
00:39:15,400 --> 00:39:16,400
Who isn't?

420
00:39:50,840 --> 00:39:52,570
He said he was here for revenge.

421
00:39:56,740 --> 00:39:57,740
Do you believe it?

422
00:40:07,840 --> 00:40:09,700
Even a cornered rabbit will bite.

423
00:40:13,670 --> 00:40:14,710
Who won't?

424
00:40:16,400 --> 00:40:18,260
Couldn't he wait a little longer?

425
00:41:02,800 --> 00:41:04,760
Goodbye, my love.

426
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:06,730
I'll wait for you in Chongqing.

427
00:41:11,030 --> 00:41:12,400
I'm not your love.

428
00:41:16,060 --> 00:41:17,040
Idiot.

429
00:41:23,280 --> 00:41:24,280
Coward!

430
00:41:28,480 --> 00:41:30,280
I'm not going to look for you!

431
00:41:44,480 --> 00:41:46,120
Who told you to come?

432
00:41:49,510 --> 00:41:51,110
Who told you to come?

433
00:42:13,190 --> 00:42:14,760
This world is too small.

434
00:42:16,110 --> 00:42:17,040
What do you mean?

435
00:42:18,030 --> 00:42:20,360
Where there are people, there is society.

436
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:23,030
But the society around me

437
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:24,780
is full of acquaintances.

438
00:42:35,880 --> 00:42:37,410
How has Jinbao been lately?

439
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:41,000
How could she be?

440
00:42:42,400 --> 00:42:45,000
Drinking and dancing every day,

441
00:42:45,440 --> 00:42:46,720
getting dead drunk.

442
00:42:49,440 --> 00:42:50,190
From now on,

443
00:42:51,190 --> 00:42:52,920
no one will take her home.

444
00:42:58,710 --> 00:43:00,180
Let's go check on her.
